## Project Structure

```
prompt_injection_pro/
│
├── prompt_shield/
│   ├── __init__.py          # Public API surface
│   ├── config.py            # All tuneable constants (patterns, thresholds, policies)
│   ├── detector.py          # Stage 1 — InjectionDetector
│   ├── scorer.py            # Stage 2 — RiskScorer
│   ├── policy.py            # Stage 3 — PolicyEngine
│   ├── main.py              # Orchestration — PromptShield pipeline
│   ├── cli.py               # Command-line interface
│   ├── logging_setup.py     # Centralised logging bootstrap
│   └── tests/
│       ├── __init__.py
│       ├── test_detector.py  # 25+ detector unit tests
│       ├── test_scorer.py    # 20+ scorer unit tests
│       ├── test_policy.py    # 15+ policy unit tests
│       └── test_pipeline.py  # 20+ end-to-end integration tests
│
├── pyproject.toml
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md
```

